<title>HONG KONG: SHK Properties seen seeking financing.</title>
<headline>SHK Properties seen seeking financing.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sun Hung Kai Properties is seen seeking a substantial amount of financing via a loan facility, bankers said on Friday.</p>
<p>They said the property giant is arranging the deal itself and that the amount is expected to be at least HK$5 billion.</p>
<p>The tenor is between five and seven years, they said.</p>
<p>Proceeds are expected to be used partially for refinancing purposes.</p>
<p>The company declined to comment.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2847 4039</p>
